1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,521
The Birds: when the skies darken, pure animal terror follows.

2
00:00:03,741 --> 00:00:05,427
Here's how this vignette plays.

3
00:00:06,233 --> 00:00:09,913
There's no Killer board: put the Bloodlust and Bird Spawn cards next to the

4
00:00:09,913 --> 00:00:11,631
Location, and start Horror at four.

5
00:00:11,851 --> 00:00:16,137
Put a three-Bird token on the Killer's start space, then one Bird on every empty

6
00:00:16,137 --> 00:00:16,459
space.

7
00:00:17,267 --> 00:00:21,531
There's no Killer to defeat. To win, you must save all of the Special Victims, using

8
00:00:21,531 --> 00:00:22,749
the normal saving rules.

9
00:00:22,969 --> 00:00:27,537
Choose your difficulty: one Special Victim for easy, two for medium, three for hard.

10
00:00:27,537 --> 00:00:31,289
How hard your Final Girl's Ultimate Ability is to unlock matters too.

11
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,379
The Special Victims stay hidden until one of two things happens:

12
00:00:35,379 --> 00:00:39,631
you unlock your Ultimate Ability, or there are no normal Victims left on the board.

13
00:00:39,851 --> 00:00:43,840
Then place them in the search spaces farthest from you, no more than one per space.

14
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:48,241
They can never be attacked or killed, but otherwise they behave like normal Victims.

15
00:00:49,067 --> 00:00:53,402
You lose immediately if every space on the board has three Birds, or if your Final

16
00:00:53,402 --> 00:00:53,931
Girl dies.

17
00:00:54,767 --> 00:00:57,054
Birds are tokens, and they count as Minions.

18
00:00:57,054 --> 00:01:01,316
They never move on their own; only special effects, such as some items, move them.

19
00:01:01,536 --> 00:01:04,437
When a card shows the Spawn Birds icon, roll two dice.

20
00:01:04,437 --> 00:01:08,843
Use one die for how many Birds appear, and the other for where, using the chart on

21
00:01:08,843 --> 00:01:11,691
the Bird Spawn card. You choose which die does which.

22
00:01:11,911 --> 00:01:15,996
Depending on the roll, the chart spreads them across any spaces, puts them all in

23
00:01:15,996 --> 00:01:19,879
one space, at the nearest of certain spaces shown on the card, in the nearest

24
00:01:19,879 --> 00:01:21,745
Victim's space, or in your own space.

25
00:01:21,965 --> 00:01:26,115
Birds always spawn at least once a round, as the first step of the Killer phase, and

26
00:01:26,115 --> 00:01:27,597
Terror cards often spawn more.

27
00:01:28,433 --> 00:01:32,662
A space holds at most three Birds. If Birds need placing in a full space, put them

28
00:01:32,662 --> 00:01:36,890
in an adjacent space of your choice, spreading further out if needed until they're

29
00:01:36,890 --> 00:01:37,457
all placed.

30
00:01:37,677 --> 00:01:41,671
Some cards mention the Killer. If a card moves the Killer, spawn Birds instead.

31
00:01:41,671 --> 00:01:44,653
If it places the Killer somewhere, place three Birds there.

32
00:01:44,873 --> 00:01:48,543
Event cards that need Special Victim meeples are discarded and redrawn.

33
00:01:49,367 --> 00:01:53,367
When the Bird Attack icon resolves, Birds attack in your space, if there's at least

34
00:01:53,367 --> 00:01:55,873
one Bird there, and in every space with three Birds.

35
00:01:56,093 --> 00:02:00,395
Birds attack one target in their space, dealing damage equal to the number of Birds

36
00:02:00,395 --> 00:02:03,091
there. They always go for normal Victims before you.

37
00:02:03,311 --> 00:02:06,669
Unusually, your Reaction cards can protect anyone in your space.

38
00:02:06,669 --> 00:02:11,076
But to save a Victim, you must prevent all the damage, because one point kills them.

39
00:02:11,900 --> 00:02:16,164
You can attack Birds in a space. Each point of damage removes one Bird, and any

40
00:02:16,164 --> 00:02:17,297
extra damage is lost.

41
00:02:17,517 --> 00:02:20,139
Some items are useless against Birds, like a Bear Trap.

42
00:02:20,139 --> 00:02:23,619
That's part of the challenge, though you may swap them out if you prefer.

43
00:02:24,433 --> 00:02:28,694
A few tips. Birds spread rather than chase, so race for the exits and only kill them

44
00:02:28,694 --> 00:02:29,404
when you must.

45
00:02:29,624 --> 00:02:34,182
Melanie's Ultimate removes Birds cheaply, and small boards like Storybook Woods fill

46
00:02:34,182 --> 00:02:35,213
up fast. Good luck.

